# DDR Kampfgruppen: separate militia uniforms using the MD animation and weapon rig.
# Only militia-specific entity names are routed here; regular NVA aliases are unchanged.
# Numbered aliases cover equipment visual levels 0 through 7. Climate variants
# intentionally share the current field uniform until dedicated variants exist.

